<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1368] interpreter-setting.json may be loaded mutliple times</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1368</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There&apos;re several ways to load interpreter-setting.json, but for now we will load it multiple times. It is supposed to load only once. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here&apos;s the order to register interpreter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;load from &amp;lt;ZEPPEPLEIN_HOME&amp;gt;/conf/&amp;lt;interpreter_group&amp;gt;/interpreter-setting.json&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;load from interpreter process classpath&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;register interpreter using the old way of Interpreter.register()&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
